            <ArticleTitle>[Gated 99mTC-MIBI SPECT in assessment of left ventricle global contractility].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>21-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The complex radiodiagnostic study (synchronized 99mTc-MIBI SPECT and equilibrum ventriculography) has been made in 30 pts. The opportunity of use synchronized tomoscintigraphy for an estimation of a global left ventricle ejection fraction was shown.</AbstractText>
